usage: pack extract [options]

Options:
  --key <str>        Open a sealed archive with this secret key file
  --signer <str>     Require a signature by this public key file
  --dest <str>       Extract into this directory, made if missing (default: .)
  --mem-limit <int>  Fail rather than hold more than this many bytes of archive data
  --stats            Print memory use on stderr
Arguments:
  <archives>...      The archive to extract
